    {
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "caption": "A device manifest declares HALs, their versions, and the framework target-level.",
      "narration": "A device manifest lists each HAL's format, name, version and instances. The target level names the framework matrix it was built for.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "A device manifest",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 8,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "xml",
          "text": "<manifest version=\"2.0\" type=\"device\"\n          target-level=\"8\">\n  <hal format=\"aidl\">\n    <name>android.hardware.light</name>\n    <version>2</version>\n    <fqname>ILights/default</fqname>\n  </hal>\n</manifest>",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 20,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 38,
          "at": 500,
          "enter": "slide-up"
        },
        {
          "id": "hl",
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": "c",
          "at": 4500,
          "enter": "fade"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "Matching: every required HAL must be provided in a compatible version.",
      "narration": "Matching is per entry. Every non-optional HAL in the matrix must appear in the manifest with a version in the required range, or the pair is incompatible.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "The matching rule",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 8,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "req",
          "type": "box",
          "text": "matrix: requires ILights v1-2",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 20,
          "w": 40,
          "h": 12,
          "color": "blue",
          "at": 500,
          "enter": "pop"
        },
        {
          "id": "prov",
          "type": "box",
          "text": "manifest: provides ILights v2",
          "x": 52,
          "y": 20,
          "w": 40,
          "h": 12,
          "color": "orange",
          "at": 1500,
          "enter": "pop"
        },
        {
          "id": "a",
          "type": "arrow",
          "from": "req",
          "to": "prov",
          "at": 2800,
          "enter": "draw",
          "label": "version in range?"
        },
        {
          "id": "n",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Optional HALs may be missing; required ones may not",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 50,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 12,
          "color": "red",
          "at": 4500,
          "enter": "fade"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "caption": "Matrices also constrain kernel version and configs, SELinux version and AVB version.",
      "narration": "It goes beyond HALs. The framework matrix also states minimum kernel versions and kernel configs, the sepolicy version, and the AVB version.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "More than HALs",
          "x": 8,
